%% WYVERN-E — flight state machine (Pico 2 W, 4x 72 mm fins + active TVC)
%% Regenerated 2026-08 against CONFLICTS.md 5 frozen parameters and the corrected trajectory.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BOOT
    BOOT: BOOT — mount SD, mux + init 3x BNO085 (Game Rotation Vector), baro datum
    ARMED: ARMED — RBF pulled; launch-detect primed; camera recording
    BOOST: BOOST — F15-4; 500 Hz TVC PID stabilize→maneuver; gimbal limit ±8°
    COAST: COAST(brief) — burnout t=3.45s; NO thrust ⇒ NO TVC authority
    RECOVER: RECOVER — F15-4 motor ejection t=7.45 s via bypass tube (FC logs only)
    DESCENT: DESCENT — 18 in chute ~6.2 m/s; log to apogee+landing
    LANDED: LANDED — flush log, safe outputs
    BOOT --> ARMED: self-test pass
    ARMED --> BOOST: |a|>3g
    BOOST --> COAST: burnout (t>3.45s)
    COAST --> RECOVER: F15-4 ejection t=7.45 s
    RECOVER --> DESCENT --> LANDED --> [*]
